2 CONT
2 CONT al-Hakam II
2 CONT
2 CONT Quotations
2 CONT
2 CONT "I have now reigned above fifty years in victory or peace; beloved by my subjects, dreaded by my enemies, and respected by my allies. Riches and honours, power and pleasure, have waited on my call, nor does any earthly blessing ap
2 CONC pear to have been wanting to my felicity. In this situation, I have diligently numbered the days of pure and genuine happiness which have fallen to my lot: they amount to Fourteen: - O man! place not thy confidence in this present
2 CONC  world!"
2 CONT
