2 CONT  The origin of Muniadomna is unknown.  Pérez de Urbel suggests that she was Muniadomna, daughter of Ramiro de Asturias titular King of León & his wife Urraca ---, based on her supposed mother being present in the castle of Lara, w
2 CONC hich belonged to Muniadomna, when she witnessed two charters in 927.  He also points out the apparent corroboration from the naming of her second son after his supposed maternal grandfather.  Muniadomna is referred to as "comitiss
2 CONC ima", and her descendants referred to in Arab sources as the "Banu Muma" as a tribute to her exceptional character, which may also suggest an illustrious ancestry[102].  "Momadonna cometessa" donated property in Valzalamio to the 
2 CONC monastery of Cardeñas with her son "Fredinando Gundisalviz", her son's wife "Sancia" and their sons "Gundesalvuz Fernandez, Sanzio Fernandez" by charter dated 5 Aug [935/38][103].  Gonzalo & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)               FERNANDO González de Castilla
2 CONT
2 CONT ii)             RAMIRO González de Castilla
