2 CONT
2 CONT His father sent him to Zaragoza to be educated in the court of the Banu Qasi. Upon Alfonso's death in 910, his sons divided the kingdom. León went to García, Galicia to Ordoño, and Asturias to Fruela. Asturian primacy was neverthe
2 CONC less recognised, though Ordoño was of a harder temperament than his brothers. Upon his brother García's death in Zamora in 914, he succeeded him in León.
2 CONT
