2 CONT      Teresa Ramírez de León was born circa 926?. She was the daughter of Ramiro II "el Feroz Guerrero", rey de León and Adosinda Gutiérrez. Teresa Ramírez de León married García II Sánchez, rey de Navarra, son of Sancho I Garcés, 
2 CONC rey de Pamplona and Toda Aznárez de Larraun, in 943; His 2nd.1
