2 CONT Arnau (died young) 
2 CONT Pere Ramon (1050-1073?), murdered his father's wife, Almodis, and was exiled 
2 CONT Second wife, Blanca (origin unknown) 
2 CONT Third wife, Almodis de La Marche, countess of Limoges 
2 CONT Berenguer Ramon II, Count of Barcelona the Fratricide (1053/54-1097) 
2 CONT Ramon Berenguer II, Count of Barcelona the Towhead (1053/54-1082) 
2 CONT Inés, married Hugh d'Albo 
2 CONT Sancha, married William Raymond, count of Cerdanya 
2 CONT
