2 CONT      Estefania de Foix was the daughter of Bernardo Roger, count of Couserans, and Garsenda, countess of Bigorre.1 She was born after 1010. She was the daughter of Bernard Roger I, comte de Couserans, de Foix et de Bigorre and Ger
2 CONC sinde, comtesse de Bigorre. Estefania de Foix married García IV Sánchez "el de Nájera", rey de Navarra, son of Sancho III "el Mayor", rey de Pamplona y conde de Aragón and Gaya of Gascony, in 1038.1 Estefania de Foix died after 10
2 CONC 66.
