2 CONC t por baptismo Gelberda", stating that Teresa married "el Comte de Provença clamado Guillen Bertran"[94].  The testament of King Ramiro I, dated 29 Jul 1059, bequeathed property to “filio meo Sancio filius Ermesendis...Sancio prim
2 CONC ogenito meo, Garsea filio meo, filia mea Taresa”, and to “domina mea Sancta Maria...super Sancte Cruçe filia mea Urraka”[95].  
