1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Genealogy 
2 CONT ==== Chapter 11.  FAMILY of PEDRO ANSÚREZ
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL.htm#AnsurDiazdied1047B
2 CONT
2 CONT ANSUR Díaz, son of conde DIEGO Fernández de Saldaña & his wife Marina --- (-after 29 Sep 1047).  “...Fernando Didaz comes...Ansur Didaz, Gomez Didaz...” subscribed the charter dated 17 Feb 1035 under which King Vermudo III recogni
2 CONC sed the church of Palencia and made donations[904].  "Fernando Didaz comes…Assur Diaz, Gomez Didaz" subscribed the charter dated 1036 under which Vermudo III King of León donated property[905].  “...comite Fredinando Didaz, Asurz 
2 CONC Didaz” witnessed the charter dated 24 May 1038 under which Fernando I King of Castile granted “castellum...Vierbele” to “Garcia Eneconis”[906].  Conde [Apr/Oct] 1042.  "Assur Diaz et uxor mea Iusta" donated property in León to Leó
2 CONC n Cathedral by charter dated 29 Sep 1047[907]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m [fourthly] '''JUSTA Fernández''', daughter of [conde FERNANDO Flaínez & his wife Elvira Peláez] (-after 29 Mar 1085).  "Assur Diaz et uxor mea Iusta" donated property in León to León Cathedral by charter dated 29 Sep 1047[911]. 
2 CONC  "Iusta comitissa...cum filio meo Diaco Assuriz" donated “in villa...Uilla Alba nostram portionem...[et] in Carapipas” to Sahagún by charter dated 1065[912].  "Iuxta dicta comitissa" donated "quintam partem meam portionem…in litor
2 CONC e fluminis Orbensis…in territorie Humanie…in Sena" to León Cathedral by charter dated 19 Feb 1071[913].  “Pelagio Moniz” donated "ereditate que abemus in Uerdiaio de abibus nostris et de parentibus nostris" to the monastery of San
2 CONC  Martín and San Miguel in Pereda and “ad illa comitissa domna Iusta, monacos et sorores” by charter dated 26 Apr 1072[914].  Towards the end of her life, Justa lived at Cluny: the abbot of Cluny and his community including "comiti
2 CONC ssa de terra Spanensi...Iusta", who declared that she left “in patrio sua nec filios nec filias”, sold property of “propinquus suus aut de viri sui qui comite Ansur Didaz” to “filius [suus] alia uxori...comite domno Petro...et uxo
2 CONC re vestre comitissa domna Eilo” by charter dated 29 Mar 1085[915]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ansur & his [fourth] wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  DIEGO Ansúrez (-18 Jul 1084, bur León Cathedral). Diego & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT a) ELVIRA Díaz (-18 Jul --).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Origins 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20EARLY%20MEDIEVAL.htm#FernandoFlainezdiedafter1054B
2 CONT
2 CONT * MUNIO Flaínez, son of FLAÍN Díaz & his wife --- (-[31 Oct 961/19 Jun 962]). … m (before 13 Aug 947) FROILOBA Vermúdez, daughter of VERMUDO Núñez Conde en Cea & his first wife Argila --- . … Munio & his wife had [five] children: 
2 CONT **2.         FLAÍN Muñoz (-[998/11 Mar 1003]). ..  [m firstly ([before 975]) his first cousin, JUSTA Fernández, daughter of conde FERNANDO Vermúdez de Cea [Leon] & his wife condesa Elvira Díaz (before [955]-). m [secondly] (before
2 CONC  1 May 987) JUSTA Pépiz, daughter of [983][PEPI Alfonso/PEPI Garvísiz & his wife ---] (-after 15 Jul 1009). Conde Flaín & his [first/second] wife had five children: ('''oldest 3 children of Justa Fernández de Cea  at “El linaje de
2 CONC l Cid”''')
2 CONT ***b. FERNANDO Flaínez, son of FLAÍN Muñoz & his [second] wife Justa Pépiz (-after 1054). … m ELVIRA Peláez, daughter of conde PELAYO Rodríguez & his wife Gotina Fernández de Cea. Fernando & his wife had [eight] children: 
2 CONT ***2.         [FERNANDO Fernández (-after [13 Nov 1028]).  
2 CONT ***3.         FLAÍN Fernández (-[1061/28 May 1065]). m firstly SANCHA ---, daughter of --- (-after 28 Oct 1046).  m secondly (after 1046) TODA Fernández, daughter of FERNANDO --- & his wife --- (-after 23 Apr 1075).  
2 CONT *** 4.         '''JUSTA Fernández .  m as his [fourth] wife, conde ANSUR Díaz, son of conde DIEGO Fernández de Saldaña & his wife Marina [Ansurez] (-30 Sep 1047).'''
2 CONT ***5.         PEDRO Fernández (-after 26 Feb 1020).
2 CONT *** 6.         OVECO Fernández (-after 26 Feb 1020). 
2 CONT *** 7.         PELAYO Fernández (-after 1050).  … Conde 1043.  m ---.  The name of Pelayo's wife is not known.  Pelayo & his wife had one child:  ..
