1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Estefanía Sánchez''', the wife of Leonese count Fruela Díaz.[14][13]
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sancho_Garc%C3%A9s,_Lord_of_Uncastillo#cite_ref-FOOTNOTECanal_S%C3%A1nchez-Pag%C3%ADn198624_14-0
