1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT King of Aragon (1134-1157), Monk, gave up monastic life to marry,
2 CONT later (rejected) returned to monestary 1134
1 NOTE Before Ramiro II became King he was the Bishop de Barnastro, Roda.
2 CONT When his brother Alfonso the battler died heirless Ramiro II became King.
2 CONT He also married, Agnes daughter of Duke William IX de Aquitaine.
1 NOTE Ramiro II "El Monje" Kg av Aragonien o Navarra
1 NOTE KING OF ARAGON 1134-1137
1 NOTE His chosen vocation for the cloister was delayed until the question of succession had been resolved through his marriage and the birth of a daughter.  He then abdicated and went into the church.
1 NOTE Grt. Grt. Grandson of Sancho Garces' 1st King of Navarre. F
