2 CONT a)         [RODRIGO Rodríguez .  Salazar y Castro records his parentage[1342].  The charter dated to [1166/80], under which [his supposed brother] "Petrus Ruderici filius comiti" donated land "in Gormezes" to Burgos Cathedral, wit
2 CONC h the consent of "neptis mee Marie de Almenar"[1343], suggests that Rodrigo is unlikely to have been the brother of Pedro Rodríguez.  In that document, "neptis mee Marie de Almenar" is identified as the daughter of Pedro´s decease
2 CONC d sister Elvira, wife of Armengol [VII] Comte de Urgell.  The consent given to the donation would have been given in her capacity as Pedro´s heir.  If that is correct, it is unlikely that Pedro had other brothers and sisters who l
2 CONC eft children.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The name of Rodrigo´s wife is not known.  
2 CONT
