1 NOTE 214936919. Dronning Petronella RAMIROSDTR av Argon(11569) was born in 1136. (11570) She died on 13 Oct 1173. (11571) She was a Dronning in Aragon. (11572) Hun var arving til kongeriket Argon.
1 NOTE     ES II:58  PED OF A.H.AYERS
1 NOTE Aunt of Eleanor and namesake of niece Petronilla of Aquitai
