1 NAME Berenguer Renard /d'Empúries/ señor de Peralada, Carmenco y Rocabertí
2 GIVN Berenguer Renard
2 NSFX señor de Peralada, Carmenco y Rocabertí
2 _MARNM d'Empúries
1 NAME Berenguer d'Empúries, Vescomte de Peralada
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1098
1 OCCU Vescomte de Peralada, Seigneur de Rocaberti
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From fmgMedlands 
2 CONT
2 CONT Of the Catalan families shown in the present document, the Vescomtes de Rocaberti is one for which the least primary source material has been found.  The Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana includes a genealogical table of the family (no s
2 CONC ources cited)[1640].  This table largely reflects the primary source documents which have been identified (although some discrepancies have been noted) and some details from the table have been included below, especially relating 
2 CONC to the direct line of descent of the family. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.trianglegironi.cat/images/imatges%20i%20documents/alt%20emporda/_comuns/vescomtes%20de%20cabrenys_arbre%20genealogic.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT BERENGUER de Empúries, son of PONCE [I] Comte de Empúries & his wife Adelaida --- (-1098).  Vescomte de Pedrolada, Señor de Peralada, Carmenco y Rocabertí. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ARSENDA de Rocabertí Vescomtesa de Peralada, daughter of [GUILLEM de Rocabertí Vescomte de Perelada Seigneur de Vergès & his wife Bonadona ---].  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana r
2 CONC ecords her possible parentage, possible grandfather and great-grandfather, and her marriage.  The primary sources which confirm this information have not been identified. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  & his wife had one child:  1.         DALMAU [I] (-after 23 Jan 1129).  Vescomte de Rocabertí.  Pierre Bishop of Elna donated “condaminas de Bages, quas violario jure Dalmatius Berengarii vicecomes de Rocabertíni” to the church o
2 CONC f Elna by charter dated 23 Jan 1129[1641].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---.  The name of Dalmau´s wife is not known.  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana names her “Toda de Claramunt?/Atilia d’Angelsola?”.  The sources on which this suggested information
2 CONC  is based have not been identified.  Dalmau [I] & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         JOFRE [I] .  Vescomte de Rocabertí.  Udalgar Bishop of Elna and “Gaufredum vicecomitem de Rocabertíno” reached agreement by charter dated 11 Jun 1142, subscribed by “Gaufredi vicecomitis de Rocabertíno...Guillermi Dalma
2 CONC tii fratris eius...”[1642]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  m ERMESINDA de Vilademuls, daughter of ---.  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana records her family origin and marriage[1643].  The primary sources which confirm this information have 
2 CONC not been identified.  Jofre [I] & his wife had children:
2 CONT           i)          ERMESINDA Garsenda de Rocabertí (-before [1185]).  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana records her parentage and marriage[1644].  The primary sources which confirm
2 CONC  this information have not been identified.  m as his first wife, Infante don SANCHO de Aragón Comte de Roussillon, son of RAMON BERENGUER IV Comte de Barcelona & his wife Petronilla Queen of Aragon ([1161]-1226).  He succeeded in
2 CONC  1181 as Comte de Provence. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         GUILLEM Dalmau (-after 11 Jun 1142).  Udalgar Bishop of Elna and “Gaufredum vicecomitem de Rocabertíno” reached agreement by charter dated 11 Jun 1142, subscribed by “Gaufredi vicecomitis de Rocabertíno...Guillermi Dalm
2 CONC atii fratris eius...”[1645]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Geneanet entry Family Tree owner : Henri FREBAULT (frebault)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://gw.geneanet.org/frebault?lang=en&pz=henri&nz=frebault&p=berenger&n=d+ampurias
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Senyor de Peralada, segon fill del comte d'Empúries Ponç I, que el 1078, en morir, li deixà Peralada, Carmençó i Rocabertí en qualitat de feudatari del seu germà, el comte d'Empúries Hug II.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sembla que pot ésser identificat amb un Berenguer Renard de Carmençó, documentat a Girona el 1072. El succeí el seu fill Dalmau Berenguer, vescomte de Rocabertí.
