2 CONT Ferdinand (1178-1187), legitimized through his parents' subsequent marriage  child, b. and d. 6 February 1180, whose birth led to the death of its mother  He then formed a liaison with Urraca López de Haro, daughter of Lópe Díaz d
2 CONC e Haro, who he married in May 1187, having:
2 CONT
