2 CONT ## Father: Alfonso VII of León and Castile
2 CONT
2 CONT ## Mother: Berenguela of Barcelona
2 CONT
2 CONT ## Husband: Sancho VI of Navarre
2 CONT
2 CONT ## Sons:
2 CONT
