2 CONT Artist of painting titled "Cordelia Disinherited" by artist, John Rogers Herbert RA was an English painter who is most notable as a precursor of Pre-Raphaelitism. This wouldn't be Blancca Naverra, my 25th great grandmother. There 
2 CONC is much more on this artist at arts.com.
