2 CONC s et ele Infant uxor sua Santia" donated "medietate Salinarum" to Huerta San Martín by charter dated "Era 1240" (presumably mis-dated)[532].  m firstly ([1165]) GASTON [V] Vicomte de Béarn, son of PIERRE Vicomte de Béarn [Gavaret]
