2 CONT
2 CONT      Teresa Fernández de Traba was born circa 1154 at Lara. She was the daughter of Fernando Pérez de Traba and Sancha González. Teresa Fernández de Traba married Ferdinand II , rey de León, son of Alfonso VII "el Emperador", Rey 
2 CONC de Galicia, de León y de Castilla and Berenguela Raimundo de Barcelona, in August 1179; His 2nd. Teresa Fernández de Traba died on 7 February 1180 at Leon, Spain.1
2 CONT
