2 CONC e et Agnes”, by charter dated 1168[1462].  Robert of Torigny names "Herveus de Juen" as husband of "Guillermus Goeth…primogenitam filiam natam ex una sororem comitis Teobaldi"[1463].  m as his first wife, HERVE Seigneur de Donzy, 
