1 NOTE {geni:about_me} #According to Salazar y Castro[1135], she was SANCHA Rodríguez de Lara, daughter of RODRIGO Rodríguez de Lara & his wife ---.  
2 CONT #According to Salazar y Acha[1136], she was SANCHA Rodríguez, daughter of RODRIGO Fernández de Toroño & his wife Aldonza Pérez. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1-http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL.htm#SanchaRodriguezLaraMGonzaloRodriguezGiro
2 CONT
2 CONT ii)         [SANCHA Rodríguez de Lara .  Salazar y Castro records her parentage and marriage, citing a charter dated 1200 under which "domna Sancia Roderici…cum fratre meo Roderico Roderici" donated property in la villa de Peñalva
2 CONC  to the monastery of San Andrés de Valveni, with the consent of "Gonzalo Roderici marito meo"[1345].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' as his first wife, GONZALO Rodríguez Giron, son of RODRIGO Gutiérrez Girón & his first wife María Rodríguez ([1165]-before 1234).] 
