1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alfonso IX of León From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfonso_IX_of_Le%C3%B3n#Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfonso, father of 3 kids from his first void marriage and father of another 5 from his second void marriage, also fathered many illegitimate children, some 23 known kids in total (3 + 5 + perhaps 15 out of married life, all docum
2 CONC ented):
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfonso's children by Aldonza Martínez da Silva (daughter of Martim Gomes da Silva & Urraca Rodrigues and subsequently wife with issue of Diego Froilaz, Conde de Cifuentes, had issue): 9) Pedro Alfonso of León, 1st Lord of Tenorio
2 CONC  (ca. 1196/ca. 1200-1226), Grand Master of Santiago, married N de Villarmayor, and had issue 10) Alfonso Alfonso of León, died yong 11) Fernando Alfonso of León, died young 12) Rodrigo Alfonso of León (ca. 1210-ca. 1267), 1st Lord
2 CONC  of Aliger and Governor of Zamora, married ca. 1240 to Inés Rodriguez de Cabrera (ca. 1200-), and had issue 13) Teresa Alfonso of León (ca. 1210-), wife of Nuno Gonzalez de Lara, el Bueno, señor de Lara 14) Aldonza Alonso of León 
2 CONC (ca. 1212/ca. 1215-1266), wife, first, of Diego Ramírez Froilaz, nephew of her stepfather, without issue, and, second, of Pedro Ponce de Cabrera, (ca. 1210-), and had issue, ancestors of the notorious Ponce de León family.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Mistress of the king, Alfonso IX of Leon, with whom she had three children (possibly four)
2 CONT
2 CONT Rodrigo Alfonso de León ("1210"" d.1252). Lord of Aliger and Castro del Río and Head over the border of Andalucia. He married Ines Rodriguez, daughter of Rodrigo Fernandez de Valduerna "The Ugly", lord of Cabrera and second lieute
2 CONC nant of King Alfonso IX of León, and Teresa Froilaz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aldonza Alfonso de León (1,212-one thousand two hundred and sixty-six/1267). Diego Ramirez married Froilaz, Lord Mansfield and Wheel[citation needed], and by June 12303 to Count Pedro Ponce de Cabrera, son of the Earl of Cabrera P
2 CONC once Vela and Countess Teresa Rodriguez, Aria M. Valley . Children from this marriage were the first to bear the name Ponce de Leon. She was buried in the Monastery of Santa Maria de Nogales, located in the town of San Esteban de 
2 CONC Nogales, with her second husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT Teresa Alfonso de León. According to some historians married Nuño González de Lara "el Bueno", lord of the House of Lara.4 However, most historians argue that who married Nuño González de Lara was Teresa Alfonso de Molina, daughte
2 CONC r of infant Alfonso de Molina.2
2 CONT
2 CONT She then married a nobleman Diego Froilaz , son of Count and Countess Froila Ramirez Sanchez Fernandez, and had three more children:2 Ramiro Diaz (?-D.1268). Lord of Asturias de Santillana. He married Teresa Fernández de Lara, dau
2 CONC ghter of Fernando Alvarez de Lara and Teresa Rodríguez de Villalobos. Rodrigo Díaz de Cifuentes Sancha Díaz de Cifuentes. She married Rodrigo Alvarez de Lara, illegitimate son of Álvaro Núñez de Lara and Teresa Gil de Osorno.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
