2 CONC tro.  Salazar y Castro records her parentage and marriage[174].] 
2 CONT *c)         PEDRO Gómez de Aza .  Salazar y Castro records his parentage adding that he "tuvo en honor a Peñafiel…la única noticia que hallamos suya"[175]. 
