2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''''Urraca Alfonso de León (c.1197-m.1244/1258). Illegitimate daughter of King Alfonso IX of Leon and Inez Iniguez de Mendoza. Vizcaya was lady consort through her marriage to Diaz II Lope de Haro, Lord of Vizcaya.'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Family Origins'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''She was the daughter of King Alfonso IX of León and his lover, the lady Agnes Iniguez de Mendoza. Her paternal grandparents were King Ferdinand II of León and his first wife, Queen Urraca of Portugal. Her maternal grandparent
2 CONC s were Inigo Lopez de Mendoza, Llodio lord, and his wife, Maria Garcia Salvadórez.'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''She was half-sister, among others, of St. Ferdinand, King of Castile and Leon, and Prince Alfonso de Molina, father of Queen Maria de Molina.'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Biography'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''It is unknown the exact date of birth, but must have occurred in in 1197. She was the daughter of King Alfonso IX of León and her lover, the lady Agnes Iniguez de Mendoza. It is not known date on which she married II Lope Dia
2 CONC z de Haro, Lord of Vizcaya, but must be between 1215 and 1218.'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''His father, King Alfonso IX of Leon, died on September 24, 1230 in the town of Villanueva de Sarria Galician, and was succeeded on the throne by his son Leon Ferdinand III, who became king of Castile and Leon.'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''It is unknown the exact date of death, but must have occurred between 1244 and 1258'''''
