2 CONT Donna Elvira Sanchez, heiress of Ayala, etc., m. Don Pero Lopez de Ayala. He inherited the estate in Unca and Ayala from Donna Maria Sanz de Unca, and was therefore called de Ayala. He was at the conquest of Seville in 1253.
