2 CONT
2 CONT Ruqayyah (Ruqaiyah) ibn 'Affan (born bint Muhammad Banu Hashim) His wife	
2 CONT
2 CONT A'isha (Ayesha) ibn Hakam (born bint Uthman ibn Affan) His daughter
2 CONT
