2 CONT
2 CONT Biography 'Uthman ibn 'Affan (born c.580, son of 'Affan), 3rd KHALIFA [successor] OF DAMASCUS (644-56), married 1. Nayla bint Farasa (born c.605, a Christian woman); then 2. Umm Kulthum bint Muhammad; then 3. Ruquyyah bint Muhamma
2 CONC d (Umm Kulthum's sister); then 4. --- (a Jewish woman). His nepotism incensed the Hashemites, who were Muhammad's immediate family, and he was deposed (656). He died 17th July 656.
2 CONT
