1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Raymond VII married firstly, in March 1211, Sancha of Aragon, the daughter of King Alfonso II of Aragon. They had one daughter, Joan, and were divorced in 1241.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sancha of Aragon was born on 1198 in Aragon, Spain to Alfonso II, King of Aragon and Sancha of Castile, Queen of Aragon.  Sancha married Raymond VII, Count of Toulouse on March 1210/11 and had a child:  Joan of Toulouse.  Sancha a
2 CONC nd Raymond were divorced on 1241.
2 CONT
