2 CONT
2 CONT 1244 Married in Ágreda on 6 February 1221 with King James I of Aragon. After her marriage was dissolved on grounds of consanguinity in April 1229, she became a nun at the Cistercian monastery of Santa María la Real at Las Huelgas.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT King Enrique I (Henry I) of Castile Valladolid,
2 CONT
