2 CONC -Sangil 2002, p. 70. ↑ Ir para: a b Salazar y Acha 1981, p. 81. ↑ López-Sangil 2002, p. 71. ↑ López-Sangil 2002, p. 72-73. ↑ López-Sangil 2002, p. 70–73. ↑ López- Sangil 2002, p. 70.
2 CONT
