2 CONC z, R. Roiz, Teresa Roiz, Elvira Roiz, et nepote nostro Roderici Gonsalvi" sold their part in the castillo de Dueñas, after the death of their father, by charter dated 1194[1124].  The dating clause of a charter dated 9 Dec 1196, u
