2 CONC s wife ---.  According to Salazar y Acha[1136], she was SANCHA Rodríguez, daughter of RODRIGO Fernández de Toroño & his wife Aldonza Pérez.  "Domnus Gundissaluus Roderici maiordomus domini regis et uxor mea donna Sanctia" donated 
