2 CONT
2 CONT María. Perez De Guzman (born Gónzalez Girón Y Rodríguez De Lara)
2 CONT MyHeritage Family Trees Birth: 1200 - Toledo, Castilla-La Mancha, España Death: 1262 - Toledo, Castilla La Mancha, España Husband: Guillen Perez De Guzman Daughter: Mayor ó Maior Guillén De Guzmán
