1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Aldonza Alfonso de León (c. 1215-1266), fue una dama leonesa e hija ilegítima del rey Alfonso IX de León y de su amante Aldonza Martínez de Silva.
2 CONT
2 CONT Aldonza Alfonso of León (ca. 1212/ca. 1215-1266), daughter of Alfonso IX 'el Baboso' Fernández Rey de León e Aldonza Martínez da Silva, wife, first, of Diego Ramírez Froilaz, nephew of her stepfather, without issue, and, second, o
2 CONC f Pedro Ponce de Cabrera, (ca. 1210-), and had issue, ancestors of the notorious Ponce de León family.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Daughter of  King Alfonso IX of León and his mistress, the Lady Aldonza Martínez de Silva
