2 CONT 9.         ADELAIS [Ermesinde] de Montpellier .  In his testament dated 4 Nov 1202, her father bequeathed money to "filiabus meis Agneti et Adalaiz"[909].  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified
2 CONC .  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (after 1202) JOFRE [II] Vescomte de Rocaberti, son of --- (-killed in battle 1212). 
