1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#JusianaEntenzaMHugoIIIAmpurias
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          JUSIANA de Entenza (-after 1192).  Señora de Alcolea.  “Hugo Impuritanensis comes...cum comitissis Brunissendis...matre mea et Jusiane uxore mea et filio nostro Poncio et Poncio fratre meo” donated the serf “Castilione
2 CONC m filium Petri Juliani” to Santa Maria de Roses by charter dated 7 Dec 1167[2484].  "Ugo…comes Impuriarum" donated property to the monastery of Poblet by charter dated 11 Nov 1170, subscribed by "Iosiane comitisse, Poncii filii eo
2 CONC rum"[2485].  “Brunisendis comitissa” donated “mansum...in parroechia Sancti Iuliani de Virginibus quem inhabitat Guililemus Firma Colades” to Sant Daniel de Girona, for the soul of “viri mei Poncii Ugonis comitis”, with the advice
2 CONC  of “filii mei Poncii”, by charter dated 20 Apr 1173, signed by “Brunisendis comitisse, Poncii filii eius, Iusiane comitissa, Poncii filii eius”[2486].  “Poncius Ugonis...Impuriarum comes” confirmed navigation rights from cap de C
2 CONC reus to La Muga for Santa Maria de Roses by charter dated 26 Jan 1184, signed by “Jusiane matris eius...”[2487].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' HUG [III] Comte de Empúries, son of PONCE [II] Comte de Empúries & his wife Brunisenda --- (-[20 Apr 1173/25 May 1174]). 
