2 CONC tierrez" and his wife "D. Milia Iñiguez", adding in a later passage that "D. Martin Gil" married "D. Ines Fernandez de Castro"[586].  The Livro Velho records that "D. Rodrigo Annes" married "D. Tareia Martins filha de D. Martim Gi
2 CONC l de Portugal que uençeo a lide do Porto, e de D. Inez Fernandez"[587]. 
