2 CONT
2 CONT Gautier (Walter) Flory (Gilbertus /Flory/, Hughes /Flory/, Georgio /Flory/, Hugues The "Holy" Of /Florent-Saumur/) was born 1178 in Palestine, and died Aft 1261 in Marsailles, France. He married Isabel Foix, daughter of Cecily /Tr
2 CONC encavel/ and Roger-Bernard I "The Fat" Comte De /Foix/. She was born Abt 1182, and died Abt 1244 in Foix, France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gautier (Walter) /Flory/ and Isabel /Foix/ are:
2 CONT #Folquer Flor was born 1218 in Foix, France.
2 CONT #Richard De Flor was born Abt 1220 in Terragona, Spain, and died 23 Aug 1268 in Tagliacozza, Italy.
2 CONT
