2 CONT *http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ARAGON%20&%20CATALONIA.htm#SanchaAragonBetRaymondToulouse
2 CONT
2 CONT a)    '''     Infanta doña SANCHA de Aragón''' (1205-[1206]).  "Petrus…Rex Aragoniæ et comes Barchinoniæ et dominus Montispessulani" and "Raimundo…Duci Narbonæ, Comiti Tolosæ et Marchioni Provinciæ" arranged the marriage of "filia
2 CONC m meam…et dominæ Mariæ uxoris…Sanciæ" and "Raimundo filio tuo et Reginæ Joannæ", by charter dated Oct 1205[338].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Betrothed''' (1205) to RAYMOND de Toulouse, son of RAYMOND VI Comte de Toulouse & his third wife Joan of England (Beaucaire, Gard Jul 1197-Millau, Aveyron 27 Sep 1249, bur Fontevraud).  He succeeded his father in 1222 as RAYMON
2 CONC D VII Comte de Toulouse. 
