2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/PROVENCE.htm#GersendeMGuillaumeIIMoncadadied1229
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         GERSENDE de Provence.  “Garsendis uxor quondam Ildefonsi comitis Provinciæ” donated her rights “in comitatu Forcalqueriensi”, granted by “Guillelmo quondam comite Forcalqueriensi avo meo”, to “Raymundo Berengario filio 
2 CONC meo” with “filiæ meæ sororis tuæ Garsendis” as substitute should he die, with the consent of “patre meo Raines de Castelar”, by charter dated 30 Nov 1209[427].  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been ident
2 CONC ified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' GUILLAUME [II] Vicomte de Béarn et d’Oloron, son of GUILLAUME [I] Vicomte de Béarn [Moncada] & his wife Guilleuma de Castellvell ([1185]-1229). 
2 CONT
