2 CONT Blanche of Castile (Blanca de Castilla in Spanish; 4 March 1188 – 26 November 1252), wife of Louis VIII of France.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Palencia, Spain, the third daughter of Alfonso VIII, king of Castile, and of Eleanor of England. Eleanor was a daughter of Henry II of England and his Queen consort Eleanor of Aquitaine. Wikipedia
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Founder of the Abbey of Maubuisson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: 
2 CONT
2 CONT The book, 'An Autobiography of Eleanor'.
2 CONT
