2 NOTE Blanche of Castile, Blanca de Castilla in Spanish, (March 4, 1188 – November 26, 1252), wife of Louis VIII of France. She was born in Palencia, Spain, the third daughter of Alfonso VIII, king of Castile, and of Eleanor of England.
3 CONC  Eleanor was a daughter of Henry II of England and his Queen consort Eleanor of Aquitaine.
