2 CONC he was crowned Empress at Rome with her husband 22 Nov 1220[778].  The monk Conrad´s Brevis Chronica records the death "apud Cataniam" in 1222 of "domina Constantia imperatrix…prima uxor Frederici imperatoris"[779].  King Imre & h
2 CONC is wife had one child:
