2 CONT a)         LÁSZLÓ (1199-7 May 1205, bur Székesfehérvár).  The Chronicon Dubnicense names "Ladizlaum" as the son of "Emericus" and his wife "Constancia filia regis Aragonie Cesari Friderico"[780].  The Continuatio Admuntensis for 1
