2 CONT
2 CONT Nobility. Only son of Jean I and his third wife Beatrice de St.-Pol, also known as Guillaume IV. He succeeded his father in 1191 as Comte de Ponthieu. He married Alix de France, a daughter of Louis VII, in 1195. They had one daugh
2 CONC ter who succeeded him.
2 CONT He was first buried at Notre-Dame de Balances and was transferred to Valloire in 1226.
