2 CONT The First Dynasty of Ponthieu - in French 
2 CONT The Dynasty of Belleme/Montgomery - in French 
2 CONT Montgomery family The Montgomery Family, Earls of Shrewsbury albeit with some mistakes, attributing Robert de Belleme's sister-in-law to his first wife. 
