2 CONC 18, and It is clear from this privilege that this gentleman was married to Doña Teresa Sánchez, daughter of Don Sancho Sánchez, first Lord of Arellano, and his wife, whose parents were the Counts of Comenge.Sancho Fernandez de Tov
