2 CONT THRONE OF LEON FOLLOWED WHEN HIS FATHER DIED AND THE TREATY OF BENAVENTE
2 CONT CONFIRMED HIS RIGHT TO IT 12/11/1230; 5/1/1671, AT "REQUEST" OF PHILIP IV,
