2 CONT Baldwin II remained the junior co-emperor and only heir to the throne. By agreement, 12 years old Baldwin had been betrothed to around 4 or 5 years old Marie of Brienne, a daughter of John and Berengaria, since 19 April 1229 to fi
2 CONC rmly establish the dynastic alliance of the two co-emperors and the Western Land for Crusades also, Spain.
