2 CONT 1.         GIACOPO Tiepolo (-9 Jul 1249, bur Dominican Church).  He was elected Doge of Venice in 1229.  Andrea Dandulo´s Chronicon Venetum records that "Jacobus Teupolo dux" was elected in 1229[226].  Andrea Navagiero´s Storia de
2 CONC lla Repubblica Veneziana records that "Giacomo Tiepolo" was elected Doge in 1229[227].  He abdicated.  Andrea Dandulo´s Chronicon Venetum records that "[Jacobus Teupolo]…dux" abdicated after ruling for 21 years, left the palace 2 
2 CONC Mar, died 9 Jul, and was buried "ecclesiæ Fratrum Prædicatorum"[228].  
