1 OCCU 2º senhor do morgado de Tábua
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Vasco Lourenço da Cunha, 2º senhor do morgado de Tábua=
2 CONT
2 CONT * D. VASCO LOURENÇO DA CUNHA son of D. Lourenço Fernandes da Cunha N 4 and his first wife was Mr. do Morgado da Taboa.of D. Fernão Ramires, and D. Crestina Soares ttº of Castellobrancos § 26 N 7 (Count D. Pedro ttº 51 Fl. 299 N 3)
2 CONT * Vasco Lourenço da Cunha (1210 -?) Was a nobleman of the Kingdom of Portugal and the 2nd lord of the morgado of Tábua
2 CONT * Vasco Lourenço da Cunha , Cavalier nobleman, who died before 1268, Lord of many goods, namely in Tábua and in the judgments of Faria and Penafiel de Bastuço. Knight who was at court in 1252 and had already died in 1268. He was m
2 CONC arried to Teresa Peres Portugal, daughter of D. Pedro Portugal, who in particular was governor of Zurara, who died after 1291.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''D. Teresa Pires Portel,''' daughter of D. Pedro Pires Portel, or Fernandes Portel, and his wife D. Froile Rodrigues Pereira, paternal granddaughter of D. João de Aboim Mor Butler of King D. Afonso III; and D. Pedro F
2 CONC ernandes Portel was Mr. de Portel according to Sequeira in the tense of Pereiras § 1 N 11 Sub N 9. She was the paternal granddaughter 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Estevão Vasques da Cunha s.g.'''
2 CONT * '''Martim Vasques da Cunha,'''
2 CONT * '''D. Inês Vasques da Cunha,''' wife of Afonso Mendes de Mello Sr. de Mello son of Mem Soares de Mello ttº de Mellos § 1 N 6
2 CONT * '''D. Sancha Vasques da Cunha,''' wife of Fernando Gonçalves Coronel son of D. Gonçalo Annes in the tone of Coroneis = Count D. Pedro fl. 251 N 8
2 CONT * '''Teresa Vasques,''' nun in Arouca
2 CONT
2 CONT (NFP, Gayo, CUNHAS § 1 N 5). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://pt.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vasco_Louren%C3%A7o_da_Cunha Vasco Lourenço da Cunha, by Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Lourenço Fernandes da Cunha ( 1180 -?) And Sancha Lourenço Macieira, daughter of Lourenço Gomes de Maceira . He married D. Teresa Pires Portel (c. 1210 - 1291 ) daughter of D. Pedro Pires de Portel or D. Pedro Pi
2 CONC res de Portel or even D. Pedro Pires of Portugal and D. Froile Rodrigues de Pereira, of whom he had:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Estevão Vasques da Cunha, 3rd lord of Morgado de Tábua;'''
2 CONT * '''Martim Vasques da Cunha''' ( 1235 -?)., 4th lord of Morgado de Tábua married to Joana Rodrigues de Nomães;
2 CONT * '''Inês Vasques da Cunha''' ( 1240 -?) Married Afonso Mendes de Melo , 2nd lord of Melo ;
2 CONT * '''Sancha Vasques da Cunha,''' married Fernando Gonçalves Coronel ;
2 CONT * '''Teresa Vasques freira em Arouca,'''  who was a nun at the Monastery of Arouca .
2 CONT
