1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana names “Dalmau IV †1181 vescomte de Rocaberti”, son of Jofre [I], and “Arnalda de Castellet” as parents of Jofre [II].  The primary 
