2 CONT '''1.         JOFRE [II] de Rocabertí (-killed in battle 1212).  Vescomte de Rocabertí.  '''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (after 1202) ADELAIS [Ermesinde] de Montpellier, daughter of GUILLAUME [VII] Seigneur de Montpellier & his second [bigamous] wife Agnes ---.  In his testament dated 4 Nov 1202, her father bequeathed money to "filiabus meis
2 CONC  Agneti et Adalaiz"[1646].  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Jofre [II] & his wife had children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         DALMAU [II] de Rocaberti (-1229).  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana names “Dalmau V †1229 vescomte de Rocaberti (baró de Vilademuls?)” as son of Jofre [II].  The primary 
2 CONC source which confirms this information have not been identified.  Vescomte de Rocabertí.  '''m ARSENDA de Pinos''' [or Bonet?], daughter of ---.  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana nam
2 CONC es “Arsenda de Pinos (o Bonet?)” as wife of Dalmau [V].  The primary source which confirms this information have not been identified.  Dalmau [II] & his wife had children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT **i)          HUG JOFRE [I] de Rocabertí (-1250).  The genealogical table of the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana names “Hug Jofre I †1250 vescomte de Rocaberti (baró de Vilademuls?)” as son of Dalmau.  The prima
2 CONC ry source which confirms this information have not been identified.  Vescomte de Rocabertí.  '''m MARÍA de Aragon''', [illegitimate daughter of PEDRO II "el Católico" King of Aragon & his mistress ---].  The genealogical table of 
2 CONC the Rocaberti family in the Gran Enciclopèdia Catalana names “(Maria de Aragó?)” as wife of Hug Jofre [I].  The primary source which confirms this information have not been identified.  If she was the daughter of Pedro II, she was
2 CONC  born before 1213, which from a chronological point of view seems unlikely considering the marriage date of Hug Jofre [I]’s paternal grandparents shown above. 
