0 @N6000000002906300674@ NOTE DESCENT:  Frederick Lewis Weis and Walter Lee Sheppard, Jr., Ancestral Roots of Certain American Colonists Who Came to America Before 1700, 7th ed., at 104 (1992).  Line 113A-25.
