0 @N6000000000337209097@ NOTE (Research):Alphonso II the Chaste of Aragón, King of Aragón  Born: MAY 1152 Acceded: 1162 Died: 25 APR 1196 Notes: Count of Barcelona, Marquis of Provence. Also known as "The Troubador". Sources conflict on his spouse.  Father: , 
1 CONC Raymond Berengar IV the Saint, Count of Provence   Mother: Ramirez, Petronilla, Queen of Aragón, b. 1135   Married 18 JAN 1174, Saragosa to , Sancha of Castile, Infanta of Castile   Child 1: , Pedro II the Catholic of Aragón, King
1 CONC  of Aragón Child 2: , Alphonso II of Provence, Count of Provence Child 3: , Ramon Berengar, Cde de Ampurias Child 4: , Sanc Child 5: , Fernando Child 6: , Constance of Hungary, Queen of Hungary   Married CIR 1160 to , Mafalda
