1 CONC alencia, but it did not survive him. - Frederick L. Weis {"Ancestral Roots of Sixty New England Colonists", Lancaster, Mass., 1950"} suggests that Alphonso VIII is son of Fernando II, King of Leon (d.1188) and his wife Urraca of P
