1 CONT TEXT 110-28; 114-27; 120-28He was a forceful personality who brought therestful nobles under control.  As a result of
1 CONT allying with the Almohads against his 1st cousin Alfonso VIII of Castilehis kingdom was placed under papal interdiction & he was forced to marryAlfonso VIII's daughter.
