0 @N6000000005076664344@ NOTE Eleanor Plantagenet was born on 13 October 1162 at Domfront Castle, Domfront, Normandy, France.2 She was the daughter of Henry II 'Curtmantle' d'Anjou, King of England and Eleanor, Duchesse d'Aquitaine. She married Alfonso VIII, R
1 CONC ey de Castilla, son of Sancho III, Rey de Castilla and Blanche de Navarre, in September 1170 at Burgos Cathedral, Burgos, Castile, Spain.2 She was also reported to have been married in 1177. She died on 31 October 1214 at age 52 a
1 CONC t Burgos, Castile, Spain.3 She was buried at Abbey of Las Huelgas, Burgos, Castile, Spain.3
