1 CONT Count of Anjou. Duke of Normandy. Coronation: June 14, 1170, Westminster Abbey, England. Coronation: August 27, 1172, Winchester Cathedral, Hampshire, England. Henry was styled as, *Rex Filius* in his coronation proclamation. He w
1 CONC as crowned by Roger of Pont l'Eveque, Archbishop of York, and again by Rotrou, Archbishop of Rouen. After the Young King's death, his father Henry II said, *He has cost me enough, but I wish he had lived to cost me more*. Henry wa
1 CONC s first buried at Le Mans, before moved to Rouen. Portrayed by Riggs in the 1964 film, *Becket*. Source: RoyaList. *Europaeische Stammtafeln* says he married 21 Aug 1172. 
