0 @N6000000003637306739@ NOTE Irene Angelina (1181 - 1208) was the daughter de the Byzantine Emperor Isaac II Angelos by his first wife Herina Tornikaina[1]. Her paternal grandparents were Andronikos Dukas Angelos and Euphrosyne Kastamonitissa.
